        {
          "text": "Pele akati kabantu ba-Israyeli katakwe Solomoni ngwakanjizya mubuzike kukubeleka milimo yakwe. Bakaba basilumamba bakwe abasilutwe bakwe abapati bankalaki zyakwe abasimabbiza bakwe. ",
