        },
        {
          "text": "Lino mwana musimbi wa-Farao, Solomoni wakamugwisya mumunzi wa-Davida akumuleta kuŋanda njaakamuyakila, nkaambo wakati, Mukaangu takonzyi kukala kulindime muŋanda ya-Davida mwami wa-Israyeli, nkaambo mpolisika ibbokesi lya-Leza alasalala.",
          "type": "text",
