          "text": "Buzuba bumwi abumwi kwakapaizigwa mbubonya mbukweelede, mbuli mbwaakalailila Musa kumakani aamasabata, amapobwe aamwezi mupya, amapobwe otatwe aamumwaka, nkukuti ipobwe lyazinkwa zitakwe bumena apobwe lyansondo apobwe lyazilao. ",
