        {
          "text": "Mbubonya mbwaakalailila Davida wisi wakabamba inkamu zyabapaizi mumilimo yabo, aba-Levi abalo kuti bacite milimo yabo yakutembaula akukutauka kubusyu bwabapaizi, mbubonya mbukweelede buzuba bumwi abumwi, abasikulindila milyango bakabikilwa mulyango umwi aumwi, nkaambo kakuti mbuboobo mbwaakalailila Davida muntu wa-Leza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
